---
/**
 * MusicToggle — "Müzik: Açık/Kapalı", the background music's own switch,
 * next to "Efektler" in the HUD of every Game that has music (GameShell
 * renders it when given `music`) and on the hub. `bindMusicToggles()` in
 * `src/lib/bday26/music-dom.ts` binds it by `data-music-toggle`, paints its
 * icon (🎵 on, 🔇 off), label and `aria-pressed` from her stored preference,
 * and flips it on a click. Like the effects' switch it never takes focus and
 * sits above the shell's screens.
 */
---

<button
  class="music-toggle"
  type="button"
  tabindex="-1"
  data-music-toggle
  aria-pressed="true"
  aria-label="Müzik: Açık"
  title="Müzik: Açık"
>
  <span class="music-icon" data-music-icon aria-hidden="true">🎵</span>
  <span class="music-label" data-music-label>Müzik: Açık</span>
</button>

<style>
  .music-toggle {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 11;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 12px 6px 8px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--bd-paper);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px var(--bd-line);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--bd-ink-soft);
    white-space: nowrap;
    cursor: pointer;
    outline: none;
  }
  .music-toggle:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--bd-accent);
  }
  .music-toggle[aria-pressed="false"] {
    color: var(--bd-muted);
  }
  .music-icon {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
</style>
